    65	/**
    66	 * Keep native-host, managed cross-provider, and explicit degraded assurance
    67	 * semantically disjoint. A managed receipt is the only cross-provider CLI path
    68	 * into REVIEW evidence; degraded single-host evidence remains a local DONE
    69	 * assurance fact and never borrows either reviewer authority path.
