   206	  // spec.json, events.jsonl, result.json and the readdir unguarded: a partially
   207	  // written or pruned run directory (pruneExpiredManagedHostRuns can delete one
   208	  // that is later re-verified) made verification THROW instead of returning the
   209	  // intended diagnostic refusal, so an operator saw a stack trace rather than a
