   222	 * until the timeout fires (SIGKILL). read-only (`-s read-only`) forbids Codex from
   223	 * modifying the reviewed code. Synchronous by blocking on the child via a small
   224	 * spin is avoided — the seam returns a Promise the leaf awaits.
